user.description:
Enter your WeChat openId and bound phone number.

**How to get the openId**:
1. Open the Chuanglvjia mini program in WeChat while running a packet capture (HttpCanary / Stream / Charles);
2. Copy the openId field (starts with oyv-) from the request body of POST /ae_oss/wx/user/oneKeyEmpower;
3. If the mini program is already logged in, delete it from WeChat and reopen it once to trigger a login request.

The integration exchanges a token with the cloud using openId + phone, and refreshes it automatically.
